1: !hal.buffer_view, %arg2: !hal.buffer_view) -> !hal.buffer_view attributes {iree.abi.stub, iree.reflection = {iree.abi.declaration = \"sync func @add_20x20xcomplex64_20x20xcomplex64_20x20xcomplex64(%input0: tensor<20x20xcomplex<f32>>, %input1: tensor<20x20xcomplex<f32>>, %input2: tensor<20x20xcomplex<f32>> {iree.abi.output = 0 : index}) -> (%output0: tensor<20x20xcomplex<f32>>)\"}} {\n    %c3200 = arith.constant 3200 : index\n    %c0 = arith.constant 0 : index\n    %c20 = arith.constant 20 : index\n    %element_type_complex3Cf323E = hal.element_type<complex<f32>> : i32\n    %dense_row_major = hal.encoding_type<dense_row_major> : i32\n    hal.buffer_view.assert<%arg0 : !hal.buffer_view> message(\"input0\") shape([%c20, %c20]) type(%element_type_complex3Cf323E) encoding(%dense_row_major)\n    %0 = stream.tensor.import on(#hal.device.affinity<@__device_0>) %arg0 : !hal.buffer_view -> tensor<20x20xcomplex<f32>> in !stream.resource<external>{%c3200}\n    hal.buffer_view.assert<%arg1 : !hal.buffer_view> message(\"input1\") shape([%c20, %c20]) type(%element_type_complex3Cf323E) encoding(%dense_row_major)\n    %1 = stream.tensor.import on(#hal.device.affinity<@__device_0>) %arg1 : !hal.buffer_view -> tensor<20x20xcomplex<f32>> in !stream.resource<external>{%c3200}\n    %2 = stream.tensor.import on(#hal.device.affinity<@__device_0>) %arg2 : !hal.buffer_view -> tensor<20x20xcomplex<f32>> in !stream.resource<external>{%c3200}\n    %c0_0 = arith.constant 0 : index\n    %3 = stream.cmd.execute on(#hal.device.affinity<@__device_0>) with(%0 as %arg3: !stream.resource<external>{%c3200}, %1 as %arg4: !stream.resource<external>{%c3200}, %2 as %arg5: !stream.resource<external>{%c3200}) {\n      stream.cmd.dispatch @add_20x20xcomplex64_20x20xcomplex64_20x20xcomplex64_dispatch_0::@add_20x20xcomplex64_20x20xcomplex64_20x20xcomplex64_dispatch_0_elementwise_400_complex_f32_(%c0, %c0, %c0 : index, index, index) {\n        ro %arg3[%c0_0 for %c3200] : !stream.resource<external>{%c3200},\n        ro %arg4[%c0_0 for %c3200] : !stream.resource<external>{%c3200},\n        rw %arg5[%c0_0 for %c3200] : !stream.resource<external>{%c3200}\n      }\n    } => !stream.timepoint\n    %4 = stream.timepoint.await %3 => %2 : !stream.resource<external>{%c3200}\n    %5 = stream.tensor.export on(#hal.device.affinity<@__device_0>) %4 : tensor<20x20xcomplex<f32>> in !stream.resource<external>{%c3200} -> !hal.buffer_view\n    util.return %5 : !hal.buffer_view\n  }\n```","created_at":"2025-04-30T15:32:15Z","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/15652#issuecomment-2842389753","id":2842389753,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/15652","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDODGgK6M6pa2z5","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/2842389753/reactions"},"updated_at":"2025-04-30T15:32:15Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/2842389753","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75337?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benvanik","id":75337,"login":"benvanik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75337?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benvanik","id":75337,"login":"benvanik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75337?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benvanik","id":75337,"login":"benvanik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik","user_view_type":"public"},{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1663364?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaheshRavishankar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaheshRavishankar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaheshRavishankar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaheshRavishankar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MaheshRavishankar","id":1663364,"login":"MaheshRavishankar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NjMzNjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaheshRavishankar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaheshRavishankar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaheshRavishankar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaheshRavishankar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaheshRavishankar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaheshRavishankar","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"MEMBER","body":"### What happened?\r\n\r\nInput `module.mlir`:\r\n```mlir\r\nfunc.func @add_20x20xcomplex64_20x20xcomplex64_20x20xcomplex64(%arg0: tensor<20x20xcomplex<f32>>, %arg1: tensor<20x20xcomplex<f32>>, %arg2: tensor<20x20xcomplex<f32>> {iree.abi.output = 0 : index}) -> tensor<20x20xcomplex<f32>> {\r\n  %0 = stablehlo.add %arg0, %arg1 : tensor<20x20xcomplex<f32>>\r\n  return %0 : tensor<20x20xcomplex<f32>>\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\ncompile command:\r\n```bash\r\niree-compile --iree-hal-target-backends=llvm-cpu --iree-input-demote-i64-to-i32=false --iree-input-demote-f64-to-f32=false --iree-opt-demote-f64-to-f32=false module.mlir -o module.vmfb\r\n```\r\n\r\ndump:\r\nhttps://gist.github.com/okkwon/a072d670831ba80580481db9aece2184\r\n\r\nThe same op with a different type, e.g., f16 works as expected. (No `stream.resource.alloca`.)\r\n\r\ndump for f16:\r\nhttps://gist.github.com/okkwon/389e2dda53cc4bd69c0a51b0e53c68a6\r\n\r\nOne biggest difference is that for complex<f32>, there are multiple ops generated, and the ops are not inlined into the top level function with iree.hal.buffer. `iree.abi.output` is not honored during the private function lowering. For example, IPO removes the operand. \r\n\r\n","closed_at":"2025-04-30T15:32:15Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75337?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benvanik","id":75337,"login":"benvanik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":2,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/15652/comments","created_at":"2023-11-20T19:30:52Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/15652/events","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/15652","id":2002862412,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":false,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1553038945,"name":"bug 🐞","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNTUzMDM4OTQ1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/labels/bug%20%F0%9F%90%9E"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"1d76db","default":false,"description":"Relating to the IREE compiler dialects (flow, hal, vm)","id":1921021544